WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:07.588
AI Search answers questions from everything in your workspace, and from the web when you want it to. Here’s how to use it.

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:18.288
Open AI Search from the sidebar, and ask a question in plain English. For example: which food safety issues did we have this month, and are any still open?

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:23.981
It looks through your tickets, docs, and connected tools, and only uses what you’re allowed to see.

00:00:24.433 --> 00:00:28.913
You get a short answer first, and a numbered list of the sources it used underneath.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:39.897
To look beyond your workspace, turn on Web Search. AI Search then checks the web and your workspace together, like whether your walk-in limit matches the FDA Food Code.

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:44.195
Web pages show their site in the sources. Click one to open it.

00:00:44.967 --> 00:00:53.607
You can also paste a link, or just a web address, right into your question. AI Search reads the page, and answers using your workspace too.

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:59.485
Here, the supplier’s grinders are matched against the purchase request already waiting for approval.

00:00:59.933 --> 00:01:08.253
To ask about a file, attach it. And every search is saved: open the sidebar to find past chats, search them, or keep them in folders.
